<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-2"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-2')">2</a>. A hispanic candy-bar company by a similar name (█████ ███) exists, but they produce a different kind of candy-bar.</div>
